1
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,000
I fled the sterile room of blinding white,

2
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Where Sade was playing on the vinyl tray.

3
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Your raucous scream still echoes in my ears,

4
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
As on the floor in panic wild you lay.

5
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,500
I ran out to the cold and freezing street,

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,500
My heart was hammering inside my chest.

7
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:16,500
A sudden terror driving every step,

8
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,500
Away from shadows that would give no rest.

9
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:31,920
Under the orange glow of one lone lamp,

10
00:01:34,819 --> 00:01:38,319
My steaming breath turns into frosty clouds.

11
00:01:40,909 --> 00:01:44,409
I see you curled in fear against the wall,

12
00:01:47,019 --> 00:01:50,519
Your broken voice still screaming out aloud.

13
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:56,680
It was no strike at me, no wild attack,

14
00:01:59,170 --> 00:02:02,670
You fought the ghosts that haunt your broken past.

15
00:02:05,189 --> 00:02:08,689
Your sterile room is just a shield you built,

16
00:02:11,370 --> 00:02:14,870
To make a fragile safety somehow last.

17
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:45,370
The lion in my chest no longer roars,

18
00:02:47,830 --> 00:02:51,330
It only aches with deep and quiet pain.

19
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:56,960
I cannot leave you drowning in your grief,

20
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:02,900
Out in the dark where all your monsters reign.

21
00:03:05,949 --> 00:03:09,449
I turn around upon the icy stones,

22
00:03:12,139 --> 00:03:15,639
And face the heavy portal in the night.

23
00:03:18,139 --> 00:03:21,639
I walk back to the door I left ajar,

24
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:27,699
To stand beside you in the orange light.